    "name": "Nanima",
    "steam_appid": 3395890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart, so you'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions from their remains to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and augments to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, weights, and fins to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be helped along the way a massive assortment of perks and upgrades that allow you to adapt to any situation within The Crevasse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/b4a7c8ff7613544b3c62479c43612ea5.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart, so you'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions from their remains to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/a1561796453a44b558404d315ab040f1.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and augments to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, weights, and fins to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.poster.avif?t=1749279127\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.webm?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/extras/ec2cf15c264b50c43efb881aedbbe970.mp4?t=1749279127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be helped along the way a massive assortment of perks and upgrades that allow you to adapt to any situation within The Crevasse.</p>",
    "short_description": "Nanima is a physics-based microscopic ship-builder where creativity drives combat. Salvage parts from defeated enemies and attach them to your ship on the fly in order to navigate a harsh microbial world.",
